  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "29",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "29",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "A Letter to the Exiles",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is the text of the letter that the prophet Jeremiah sent from Jerusalem to the surviving elders among the exiles and to the priests, the prophets and all the other people Nebuchadnezzar had carried into exile from Jerusalem to Babylon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(This was after King Jehoiachin",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "and the queen mother, the court officials and the leaders of Judah and Jerusalem, the skilled workers and the artisans had gone into exile from Jerusalem.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He entrusted the letter to Elasah son of Shaphan and to Gemariah son of Hilkiah, whom Zedekiah king of Judah sent to King Nebuchadnezzar in Babylon. It said:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "pm"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.29.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.29.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty, the God of Israel, says to all those I carried into exile from Jerusalem to Babylon:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Build houses and settle down; plant gardens and eat what they produce.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Marry and have sons and daughters; find wives for your sons and give your daughters in marriage, so that they too may have sons and daughters. Increase in number there; do not decrease.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Also, seek the peace and prosperity of the city to which I have carried you into exile. Pray to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.29.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.29.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for it, because if it prospers, you too will prosper.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yes, this is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.29.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.29.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty, the God of Israel, says: \"Do not let the prophets and diviners among you deceive you. Do not listen to the dreams you encourage them to have.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They are prophesying lies to you in my name. I have not sent them,\" declares the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.29.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.29.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "pm"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.29.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.29.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "says: \"When seventy years are completed for Babylon, I will come to you and fulfill my good promise to bring you back to this place.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I know the plans I have for you,\" declares the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.29.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.29.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", \"plans to prosper you and not to harm you, plans to give you hope and a future.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then you will call on me and come and pray to me, and I will listen to you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You will seek me and find me when you seek me with all your heart.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will be found by you,\" declares the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.29.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.29.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", \"and will bring you back from captivity.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "I will gather you from all the nations and places where I have banished you,\" declares the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.29.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.29.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", \"and will bring you back to the place from which I carried you into exile.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "pm"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You may say, \"The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.29.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.29.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has raised up prophets for us in Babylon,\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but this is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.29.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.29.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "says about the king who sits on David's throne and all the people who remain in this city, your fellow citizens who did not go with you into exile—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yes, this is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.29.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.29.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty says: \"I will send the sword, famine and plague against them and I will make them like figs that are so bad they cannot be eaten.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will pursue them with the sword, famine and plague and will make them abhorrent to all the kingdoms of the earth, a curse",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "and an object of horror, of scorn and reproach, among all the nations where I drive them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For they have not listened to my words,\" declares the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.29.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.29.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", \"words that I sent to them again and again by my servants the prophets. And you exiles have not listened either,\" declares the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.29.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.29.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "pm"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore, hear the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.29.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.29.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", all you exiles whom I have sent away from Jerusalem to Babylon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.29.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.29.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty, the God of Israel, says about Ahab son of Kolaiah and Zedekiah son of Maaseiah, who are prophesying lies to you in my name: \"I will deliver them into the hands of Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon, and he will put them to death before your very eyes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because of them, all the exiles from Judah who are in Babylon will use this curse: 'May the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.29.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.29.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "treat you like Zedekiah and Ahab, whom the king of Babylon burned in the fire.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For they have done outrageous things in Israel; they have committed adultery with their neighbors' wives, and in my name they have uttered lies—which I did not authorize. I know it and am a witness to it,\" declares the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.29.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.29.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
