        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Message to Shemaiah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tell Shemaiah the Nehelamite,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.29.25",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.29.25"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Almighty, the God of Israel, says: You sent letters in your own name to all the people in Jerusalem, to the priest Zephaniah son of Maaseiah, and to all the other priests. You said to Zephaniah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "'The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.29.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.29.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has appointed you priest in place of Jehoiada to be in charge of the house of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.29.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.29.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; you should put any maniac who acts like a prophet into the stocks and neck-irons.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So why have you not reprimanded Jeremiah from Anathoth, who poses as a prophet among you?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He has sent this message to us in Babylon: It will be a long time. Therefore build houses and settle down; plant gardens and eat what they produce.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zephaniah the priest, however, read the letter to Jeremiah the prophet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.29.30",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.29.30"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came to Jeremiah:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Send this message to all the exiles: 'This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.29.31",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.29.31"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "says about Shemaiah the Nehelamite: Because Shemaiah has prophesied to you, even though I did not send him, and has persuaded you to trust in lies,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "this is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.29.32",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.29.32"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "says: I will surely punish Shemaiah the Nehelamite and his descendants. He will have no one left among this people, nor will he see the good things I will do for my people, declares the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.29.32",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.29.32"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", because he has preached rebellion against me.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
